 InputWithUserDefinedMenubar;defMat;DT;r;parms;props;list;menuDef;OnThisAsWell
⍝ Input with a user defined menu bar that includes the standard commands "cut", "copy" & "paste"
 DT←##.GUI.Enums.InputDataTypes
 defMat←0 7⍴''
 defMat⍪←'Key' '' 1 DT.Numeric 4 0 1
 defMat⍪←'Active' '' 1 DT.YesNo 0 1 1
 defMat⍪←'Firstname' 'First name' 'Kai'DT.Character 30 1 2
 defMat⍪←'Lastname' 'Last name' 'Jaeger'DT.Character 30 1 2

 parms←##.GUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.posn←55 35

 menuDef←''
 menuDef,←⊂'[Edit]'
 menuDef,←⊂' Cut=Ctrl+X : <cut> {cut}'
 menuDef,←⊂' Copy=Ctrl+C : <copy> {copy}'
 menuDef,←⊂' Paste=Ctrl+V : <paste> {paste}'
 menuDef,←⊂'[Misc]'
 menuDef,←⊂' This as well : OnThisAsWell {this}'
 parms.menubar←menuDef
 OnThisAsWell←{.}

 r←parms ##.GUI.Input.Run defMat
 ⎕SE.aplteam.Display r
⍝Done
